WEBVTT

01:33.330 --> 01:36.084
(Fireworks of My Heart)

01:36.184 --> 01:37.986
(Adapted from the novel "A City, Waiting for You" by Jiuyuexi)

01:38.086 --> 01:40.889
(Episode 2)

01:44.562 --> 01:45.521
Still can't forget her?

01:45.682 --> 01:46.721
Long forgotten.

01:46.962 --> 01:48.402
I didn't even say who.

01:49.001 --> 01:50.562
Why so eager to answer?

01:51.721 --> 01:52.962
Is it that female doctor?

01:54.081 --> 01:54.682
No.

01:56.202 --> 01:57.202
I don't believe you.

01:58.641 --> 02:00.360
I saw you two chatting.

02:00.361 --> 02:01.202
I don't know her.

02:02.801 --> 02:04.161
You say one thing but mean another.

02:06.641 --> 02:07.842
What are you laughing about?

02:08.402 --> 02:09.482
I'm happy.

02:09.602 --> 02:10.801
It's good that you're taken.

02:11.801 --> 02:12.681
Now that you're taken,

02:13.162 --> 02:14.561
I can set my wedding date.

02:15.162 --> 02:16.162
What the heck?

02:16.322 --> 02:17.241
Get married if you want.

02:17.762 --> 02:18.681
Why wait for me?

02:21.602 --> 02:24.002
How come that sounded a bit depressing?

02:31.602 --> 02:32.521
An ex-girlfriend?

02:39.442 --> 02:40.442
I guess that means yes.

02:41.801 --> 02:43.002
She looks quite pretty

02:43.322 --> 02:44.482
and has a good aura.

02:45.361 --> 02:46.961
So why did you two break up?

02:49.401 --> 02:50.162
Time for patrol.

02:52.282 --> 02:53.162
Wait up.

02:53.162 --> 02:54.162
I'll go with you.

03:21.641 --> 03:22.202
Try it.

03:24.801 --> 03:25.841
It's sour.

03:28.401 --> 03:29.564
Yet sweet.

03:30.531 --> 03:31.199
This taste...

03:31.866 --> 03:33.001
It's amazing.

03:42.410 --> 03:43.378
Try one.

03:44.521 --> 03:46.547
If you don't like it, I'll give you my life.

04:07.882 --> 04:08.841
Amazing.

04:09.561 --> 04:10.482
Isn't it?

05:03.725 --> 05:07.539
"Song Yan"

05:20.041 --> 05:22.963
(China Fire and Rescue)

05:23.077 --> 05:24.178
(Detachment Captain's Office)

05:28.681 --> 05:29.201
Reporting.

05:29.321 --> 05:29.801
Come in.

05:36.722 --> 05:39.241
You put out the fire at Wufang Street.

05:39.801 --> 05:40.642
You did a deed of merit.

05:46.321 --> 05:47.401
These tea leaves look pretty good.

05:47.402 --> 05:48.402
How come I haven't seen it before?

05:48.642 --> 05:49.201
Put it down.

05:52.321 --> 05:53.042
Get over here!

05:57.561 --> 05:58.602
Forget tea leaves.

05:59.241 --> 06:00.560
Commendation awards and whatnots

06:00.561 --> 06:01.561
can all get lost.

06:03.121 --> 06:05.521
I just received three complaints.

06:05.522 --> 06:07.001
Three!

06:08.681 --> 06:09.282
The first one,

06:09.482 --> 06:11.561
the associate organizations complained that

06:12.681 --> 06:13.800
you were uncooperative.

06:13.801 --> 06:16.000
You were brusque and rough.

06:16.001 --> 06:16.722
Second.

06:16.922 --> 06:18.800
The public made a complaint

06:18.801 --> 06:19.841
regarding your bad attitude

06:19.842 --> 06:21.962
and damage to their car.

06:22.842 --> 06:23.961
Third.

06:23.962 --> 06:25.482
Your peers complained

06:25.722 --> 06:27.881
that you disregarded the instructor's orders.

06:29.001 --> 06:30.320
You were uncooperative, had a bad attitude,

06:30.321 --> 06:31.042
and you didn't obey your instructor.

06:31.043 --> 06:32.162
You...

06:32.361 --> 06:33.602
Aren't you...

06:33.881 --> 06:36.162
Aren't you going to explain yourself?

06:38.082 --> 06:38.842
The car should be removed.

06:39.082 --> 06:39.842
That person should be beaten.

06:40.282 --> 06:41.522
Inability deserves a reprimand.

06:42.722 --> 06:43.722
If you don't like me,

06:44.042 --> 06:45.241
just reassign me elsewhere.

06:48.522 --> 06:50.001
You think I don't dare?

06:50.441 --> 06:52.962
You keep making trouble for me.

06:53.162 --> 06:56.000
Every month, there's something new.

06:56.001 --> 06:56.681
Chief Gao.

06:57.922 --> 06:58.722
You speak.

07:00.402 --> 07:02.009
Sir, don't get worked up.

07:02.321 --> 07:03.842
I've looked into the situation.

07:03.881 --> 07:05.922
The situation was dire.

07:06.162 --> 07:07.282
Comrade Song Yan

07:07.361 --> 07:09.201
and the comrades from Wufang Fire Station

07:09.241 --> 07:11.482
had a bit of a disagreement on the plan of action.

07:11.801 --> 07:13.760
They went ahead with Song Yan's method

07:13.761 --> 07:15.522
and managed to prevent the fire from spreading.

07:16.842 --> 07:18.441
Regarding the car removal,

07:18.722 --> 07:20.521
as they couldn't reach the owner of the car

07:20.522 --> 07:22.241
parked on a fire route,

07:23.001 --> 07:24.298
Song Yan did what he did

07:24.361 --> 07:25.880
to ensure they got to the fire as quickly as possible

07:25.881 --> 07:28.761
and minimize damages to the public's well-being and property, am I right?

07:30.522 --> 07:33.200
You always come up with all sorts of reasons

07:33.201 --> 07:34.201
to cover him.

07:34.522 --> 07:36.680
Sir, you always say this.

07:36.681 --> 07:37.922
The scene of a fire is like a battlefield.

07:38.361 --> 07:40.881
There are many variables working on the frontline.

07:41.201 --> 07:43.561
It's hard to please everyone.

07:45.121 --> 07:48.162
If Song Yan hadn't insisted on going ahead with his team,

07:48.922 --> 07:50.881
the little boy and girl

07:51.482 --> 07:52.561
wouldn't have been saved.

07:55.722 --> 07:56.241
Fine.

07:56.681 --> 07:58.201
I won't pursue the other two complaints.

07:59.441 --> 08:00.922
As for the removal of the car,

08:01.082 --> 08:02.721
that's clearly a bad rep.

08:02.722 --> 08:03.801
It has to be resolved.

08:04.001 --> 08:04.402
Yes.

08:04.681 --> 08:05.602
Make him write a report.

08:06.082 --> 08:08.321
I already submitted one. You want me to write another?

08:08.642 --> 08:10.361
That means it was not good enough.

08:10.522 --> 08:11.282
Do it over.

08:12.241 --> 08:12.842
Write it.

08:13.201 --> 08:14.082
3000 words.

08:15.962 --> 08:17.282
Not even a word less.

08:17.561 --> 08:18.561
Every word you miss

08:19.602 --> 08:20.681
will be fined 1000 yuan.

08:27.001 --> 08:27.761
Song Yan.

08:30.561 --> 08:31.561
Song Yan.

08:35.841 --> 08:38.041
I heard that a couple of gas tanks had exploded at the scene.

08:38.042 --> 08:38.922
It was precarious.

08:40.081 --> 08:41.242
I'm not trying to nag.

08:41.561 --> 08:44.081
But can you not be so rash when something happens?

08:45.042 --> 08:46.042
Saving lives is important,

08:46.043 --> 08:47.402
but don't neglect your own safety.

08:47.841 --> 08:50.481
Now, I get anxiety whenever your team goes on a mission.

08:52.681 --> 08:53.854
Thanks for your concern, Madam.

08:54.002 --> 08:54.882
I'm leaving.

08:55.362 --> 08:56.002
I...

09:05.162 --> 09:07.841
That new doctor, Xu Qin, is pretty good.

09:08.122 --> 09:10.960
I heard she would be getting the spot on the research team.

09:10.961 --> 09:11.801
Based on what?

09:12.081 --> 09:13.681
Just because she studied in the US?

09:13.961 --> 09:15.440
She's still a rookie.

09:15.441 --> 09:16.642
Does she have the experience?

09:17.841 --> 09:19.522
That's why she was assigned to the ER.

09:19.681 --> 09:21.441
After some time, she'd be put on the research team.

09:21.922 --> 09:23.522
It may not seem justified,

09:23.841 --> 09:25.681
but you can't really name any problems.

09:26.441 --> 09:27.441
Guess it's a special admission.

09:27.561 --> 09:28.801
In my opinion,

09:28.961 --> 09:31.242
you should get the spot.

09:31.801 --> 09:32.881
You're older than her,

09:32.882 --> 09:33.882
more experienced.

09:34.162 --> 09:35.002
But unfortunately,

09:35.242 --> 09:36.362
she has backing.

09:37.402 --> 09:39.721
Anyone can find support if it's about connections.

09:39.922 --> 09:41.441
Who doesn't have connections and backgrounds?

09:42.242 --> 09:43.841
Her background is special though.

09:44.282 --> 09:45.882
I heard her surname was Meng.

09:46.201 --> 09:47.961
She changed it in order to keep a low profile.

09:49.242 --> 09:49.961
Meng?

09:49.961 --> 09:50.721
What about Meng?

09:51.402 --> 09:52.480
Guo Kun Group.

09:52.481 --> 09:53.601
For real?

09:53.801 --> 09:55.162
Her dad is Meng Huai Jin?

09:55.402 --> 09:56.561
That's what her profile said.

09:56.841 --> 09:59.162
I saw it when I was processing her onboarding.

10:00.122 --> 10:02.241
So the handsome and aristocratic guy

10:02.242 --> 10:04.201
who picks her up from work every day

10:04.681 --> 10:06.561
is the young master of Guo Kun Group?

10:06.801 --> 10:08.281
So she's untouchable,

10:08.282 --> 10:09.601
has someone to pick her up.

10:10.321 --> 10:13.081
The thought of having to work with a person who relies on connections

10:13.402 --> 10:14.441
frustrates me.

10:23.642 --> 10:25.081
If you don't want to work with me,

10:25.882 --> 10:27.441
I can talk to the head for you.

10:29.922 --> 10:30.721
Should I?

10:53.841 --> 10:54.642
Yan Chen.

10:59.162 --> 11:00.242
You got a new car?

11:01.882 --> 11:02.882
It's your car.

11:03.522 --> 11:04.441
I got it for you.

11:04.721 --> 11:05.481
Well?

11:05.522 --> 11:06.282
Do you like it?

11:07.042 --> 11:08.762
Your taste has improved.

11:09.122 --> 11:10.321
What can I do?

11:10.681 --> 11:11.721
You won't go home

11:12.002 --> 11:13.201
and you have no driver to drive you.

11:13.601 --> 11:15.201
Mum worries about your ease of commute.

11:16.321 --> 11:17.242
Try it.

11:17.321 --> 11:19.282
I'll change it if you don't like it.

11:22.441 --> 11:23.042
Thanks.

11:51.042 --> 11:52.960
The road ahead is closed due to an accident.

11:52.961 --> 11:54.242
Please take another route.

11:54.441 --> 11:55.922
Okay. Is anyone hurt?

11:56.601 --> 11:57.872
The car got badly smashed.

11:57.961 --> 11:59.642
I presume the driver is hurt bad.

11:59.882 --> 12:00.921
The ambulance will be here soon.

12:00.922 --> 12:02.121
Please don't block the road.

12:02.122 --> 12:02.721
Got it.

12:02.721 --> 12:03.561
Thanks for your cooperation.

12:14.042 --> 12:15.162
You're off duty.

12:15.801 --> 12:17.081
But I'm still a doctor.

12:18.481 --> 12:19.961
The ambulance will be here soon.

12:20.841 --> 12:22.921
The longer we wait, the more dangerous it is for the victim.

12:22.922 --> 12:23.721
Yan Chen.

12:25.441 --> 12:26.481
Stay safe.

12:37.162 --> 12:37.801
Hey there.

12:38.042 --> 12:38.801
I'm a doctor.

12:38.802 --> 12:40.002
Do you need assistance?

12:45.081 --> 12:46.402
I have a doctor here who can help.

12:46.481 --> 12:47.721
Should I let her in?

12:48.201 --> 12:49.042
(Let her through.)

12:49.522 --> 12:50.242
Got it.

12:50.634 --> 12:51.553
Come with me.

13:17.561 --> 13:18.762
The ambulance is here.

13:20.002 --> 13:22.122
We won't trouble you then.

13:22.642 --> 13:23.441
It's no trouble.

13:23.762 --> 13:24.481
Thank you.

14:26.321 --> 14:27.242
Move it away.

14:38.081 --> 14:38.882
Up.

15:15.313 --> 15:16.201
Instructor,

15:16.441 --> 15:17.481
is the vice captain not here?

15:18.282 --> 15:19.841
No, he's on station duty.

15:21.282 --> 15:22.162
Good work, guys.

15:22.402 --> 15:23.481
Come grab some food.

15:24.042 --> 15:24.882
Five minutes.

15:25.441 --> 15:26.561
Take turns to eat.

15:34.441 --> 15:35.561
You can't eat because of your toothache.

15:35.882 --> 15:36.801
Then drink some soup.

15:46.522 --> 15:47.201
How is it?

15:48.681 --> 15:49.481
Feel better?

16:00.681 --> 16:03.080
You went back and came out again?

16:03.081 --> 16:05.402
I just want you to eat up and go back to rest early.

16:12.159 --> 16:13.259
"Yuan Yuan"

16:22.242 --> 16:22.961
Hello?

16:24.242 --> 16:24.882
I've eaten.

16:25.601 --> 16:26.961
We had a mission to carry out today.

16:31.362 --> 16:32.042
I know.

16:32.481 --> 16:33.601
I'll get it done.

16:34.681 --> 16:36.961
The approval for the detachment has to follow procedure.

16:37.441 --> 16:39.801
Give me a bit more time, okay?

16:41.961 --> 16:42.762
Talk later.

17:02.721 --> 17:03.801
Are you hiding something from me?

17:04.481 --> 17:05.922
No, nothing.

17:08.201 --> 17:09.882
We sleep and eat together every day.

17:10.001 --> 17:10.842
Do you think

17:11.201 --> 17:12.521
I won't notice something is wrong?

17:13.681 --> 17:15.362
I think you're thinking too much.

17:16.721 --> 17:17.481
Fine.

17:17.802 --> 17:18.602
I won't nag.

17:19.481 --> 17:21.041
You can tell me when you're ready.

17:54.528 --> 17:56.830
(Emergency Department)

17:56.922 --> 17:58.441
For the Emergency Department,

17:58.642 --> 18:00.961
there has to be at least one professional training a week.

18:01.922 --> 18:03.041
We will focus on

18:03.681 --> 18:06.842
the treatment of critically ill patients.

18:07.041 --> 18:08.082
For example,

18:08.122 --> 18:09.201
basic rescue techniques in treating

18:10.041 --> 18:11.078
acute myocardial infarction,

18:11.241 --> 18:13.122
cerebrovascular accident,

18:13.441 --> 18:15.280
shock, and others.

18:15.281 --> 18:17.241
So while you are expected

18:17.481 --> 18:19.961
to carry out your responsibilities,

18:20.122 --> 18:23.521
we have to establish strong teamwork.

18:23.882 --> 18:24.961
In order to increase

18:25.162 --> 18:26.760
the success rate of emergency care

18:26.761 --> 18:28.041
by administering precise treatment,

18:28.322 --> 18:29.642
the department has decided

18:29.922 --> 18:31.440
to separate the Red Zone

18:31.441 --> 18:32.720
into A and B,

18:32.721 --> 18:34.082
two emergency response teams.

18:34.201 --> 18:36.001
Triage will be carried out

18:36.241 --> 18:38.162
according to the patient's condition.

18:38.642 --> 18:39.441
Understand?

18:39.442 --> 18:41.040
Yes.

18:41.041 --> 18:43.842
Yellow Zone and Green Zone are dismissed.

18:44.281 --> 18:45.162
Conduct your rounds.

18:45.402 --> 18:46.322
Red Zone, stay back.

18:53.721 --> 18:54.842
We have decided

18:55.481 --> 18:56.642
to separate Red Zone into two teams.

18:56.802 --> 18:57.802
For Team A,

18:58.761 --> 18:59.882
Yang Si Jia will be in charge.

19:00.681 --> 19:01.281
Okay.

19:01.721 --> 19:02.562
For Team B,

19:03.001 --> 19:03.882
Xu Qin will be in charge.

19:04.922 --> 19:06.922
You're free to choose your own team.

19:07.162 --> 19:08.240
I'll leave that to you.

19:08.241 --> 19:09.961
That should smoothen operations.

19:10.322 --> 19:11.001
Okay?

19:11.602 --> 19:12.961
Sir, I'll go to Team A.

19:13.481 --> 19:14.082
Sir,

19:14.602 --> 19:15.521
I'll join Team A too.

19:15.642 --> 19:17.240
Sir, I'll go to Team A too.

19:17.241 --> 19:18.281
Count me in, sir.

19:22.122 --> 19:24.681
Sir, that means my team is full.

19:35.761 --> 19:36.642
Let's go with that then.

19:47.602 --> 19:48.241
Dr Xu.

19:48.241 --> 19:48.802
Dr Xu.

19:49.082 --> 19:50.744
-Let's do the best we can. -Do our best.

19:50.961 --> 19:51.521
Get to work.

19:54.281 --> 19:55.001
Get to work.

19:56.122 --> 19:56.961
Get working.

20:00.761 --> 20:02.041
Gear up.

20:02.122 --> 20:02.882
Ready.

20:30.642 --> 20:31.760
Sir, I'm done!

20:31.761 --> 20:32.761
Sir, complete!

20:32.762 --> 20:34.321
-Done, sir. -Done!

20:35.162 --> 20:35.842
Zhan Da Peng.

20:36.082 --> 20:36.882
Pi Shao Jie.

20:37.201 --> 20:37.961
Tang Jie.

20:38.241 --> 20:39.122
You're no good.

20:39.281 --> 20:40.001
You three.

20:40.201 --> 20:40.882
Take everything off and start over.

20:40.882 --> 20:41.362
Yes, sir.

20:41.642 --> 20:42.281
Yes, sir.

20:45.001 --> 20:46.281
Ready. Focus.

20:58.761 --> 21:00.681
-Done, sir! -Done!

21:01.562 --> 21:02.402
No good.

21:03.562 --> 21:04.281
Captain,

21:04.721 --> 21:06.562
I put everything on according to the squad leader's instructions.

21:12.842 --> 21:13.922
Did you put it on tightly?

21:14.882 --> 21:15.960
In a fire,

21:15.961 --> 21:17.642
your breathing apparatus might get snatched.

21:19.521 --> 21:20.162
Sir,

21:20.602 --> 21:22.201
somebody's going to steal my breathing apparatus?

21:22.642 --> 21:24.241
Have you not heard of people trying to save someone from drowning

21:24.362 --> 21:26.707
but ended up drowning themselves due to being dragged by victims?

21:27.001 --> 21:28.842
Firefighters had lost their lives because of that.

21:29.201 --> 21:31.001
Make sure you wear your breathing apparatus securely.

21:34.922 --> 21:36.562
There's something called instinct

21:38.922 --> 21:40.201
in human nature.

22:14.602 --> 22:15.281
Gather around.

22:22.162 --> 22:23.802
If your dream is to become a firefighter,

22:24.201 --> 22:24.961
step forward.

22:25.201 --> 22:25.882
Break rank.

22:34.362 --> 22:35.402
I want to hear the truth.

22:36.082 --> 22:37.402
Why do you want to be a firefighter?

22:37.681 --> 22:38.745
Sir,

22:39.001 --> 22:40.082
because I want to save lives.

22:40.162 --> 22:41.362
I want to save the common people.

22:41.761 --> 22:42.642
Sir,

22:42.643 --> 22:44.842
I think firefighters are great.

22:45.281 --> 22:46.281
Sir,

22:46.282 --> 22:48.922
I think being a firefighter is an honourable occupation.

22:53.961 --> 22:55.562
Is that what you really think?

22:57.602 --> 22:58.521
A few days ago,

22:58.961 --> 23:00.362
in the Wufang Street fire,

23:01.001 --> 23:02.842
I received complaints.

23:03.562 --> 23:05.281
The fire station got complaints, too.

23:06.322 --> 23:07.402
Some people said

23:08.201 --> 23:10.721
that our attitude was bad while maintaining order at the scene.

23:10.882 --> 23:11.642
Last month,

23:11.802 --> 23:13.001
Yang Chi and his team

23:13.642 --> 23:14.882
saved a kid in the sewer.

23:15.481 --> 23:16.516
They were covered in filth.

23:17.082 --> 23:18.802
The stench lingered even after three days.

23:19.721 --> 23:20.441
Jiang Yi.

23:20.602 --> 23:22.362
He is away from home where his mother is.

23:22.802 --> 23:23.882
Duty-bound,

23:24.362 --> 23:25.842
he hasn't gone home to see her in two years.

23:26.721 --> 23:28.001
After hearing these stories,

23:29.402 --> 23:30.961
do you still wish to be here?

23:33.201 --> 23:35.001
Are you happy to put on this gear?

23:38.122 --> 23:39.281
The firefighting gear

23:40.082 --> 23:41.721
is not as comfortable as you think.

23:43.162 --> 23:44.001
Complaints.

23:44.521 --> 23:45.481
Grievances.

23:45.922 --> 23:47.681
No one understands the efforts you put in.

23:49.885 --> 23:51.562
It's part and parcel of being a firefighter.

23:53.721 --> 23:55.602
But why are there still hundreds of thousands of firefighters

23:56.001 --> 23:57.681
who dash out at the first sound of alarm,

23:58.001 --> 23:59.481
365 days a year,

23:59.842 --> 24:01.802
24 hours a day?

24:12.041 --> 24:13.122
Take a look.

24:15.802 --> 24:16.721
Tell me.

24:17.922 --> 24:19.241
What do you see?

24:19.922 --> 24:21.802
I see the bustling streets of the city.

24:23.241 --> 24:24.721
I see towering buildings

24:25.201 --> 24:26.201
and parks.

24:26.882 --> 24:29.402
I see residential buildings filled with warmth.

24:30.201 --> 24:31.162
I hope

24:32.122 --> 24:33.402
you have a clear view

24:34.402 --> 24:35.322
and a clear understanding.

24:36.961 --> 24:39.082
Why do we train so hard every day?

24:42.922 --> 24:43.721
It is

24:44.761 --> 24:47.402
to protect the people's everyday lives.

25:24.882 --> 25:26.040
Hurry up, will you?

25:26.041 --> 25:27.201
Wait up.

25:39.681 --> 25:41.802
Song Yan, this is vandalism.

25:43.481 --> 25:44.041
It's fine.

25:44.521 --> 25:46.121
This wall is part of the cultural spot on Wufang Street.

25:46.122 --> 25:47.067
Graffiti is fine.

25:51.602 --> 25:52.961
Well? How is it?

25:54.721 --> 25:56.122
Look at what you wrote.

25:57.281 --> 25:58.402
You don't get it?

26:00.241 --> 26:02.882
"If you smile,"

26:03.761 --> 26:05.602
"the son city."

26:07.602 --> 26:08.562
If you smile,

26:09.001 --> 26:09.961
the sun fills the city.

26:51.322 --> 26:52.322
(You must be dumb.)

26:52.802 --> 26:53.602
Look.

26:53.681 --> 26:55.161
It's not "o", but "u".

26:55.162 --> 26:57.082
You wrote "sun" as "son".

27:03.001 --> 27:04.521
So how are you going to explain this?

27:07.922 --> 27:09.041
If you smile,

27:09.521 --> 27:10.721
sons fill the city.

28:06.806 --> 28:10.410
(Zhai Residence)

28:15.842 --> 28:16.642
Who is it?

28:17.562 --> 28:18.362
Who is it?

28:22.681 --> 28:23.842
What are you doing here?

28:26.122 --> 28:27.041
Zhai Miao?

28:27.842 --> 28:29.322
You've grown up.

28:31.281 --> 28:32.398
Why did you come here?

28:32.681 --> 28:33.802
I came to find Song Yan.

28:34.602 --> 28:35.322
Song Yan?

28:35.481 --> 28:36.201
What for?

28:36.362 --> 28:37.362
Such audacity.

28:37.802 --> 28:39.802
Have you forgotten what you did?

28:40.241 --> 28:41.841
Whatever. I don't want to talk to you.

28:41.842 --> 28:42.542
He's not here.

28:42.761 --> 28:43.642
Zhao Miao.

28:52.162 --> 28:53.441
When will he be back?

28:54.082 --> 28:55.362
Why does that concern you?

28:55.642 --> 28:56.523
Ms Xu,

28:56.721 --> 28:57.960
Yan is living a good life right now.

28:57.961 --> 28:59.200
He might even get married next year.

28:59.201 --> 29:00.520
So leave him alone, will you?

29:00.521 --> 29:01.402
I'll thank you for that.

29:01.802 --> 29:02.642
Zhai Miao.

29:08.761 --> 29:09.642
Madam.

29:11.602 --> 29:12.882
Song Yan doesn't live here.

29:14.122 --> 29:15.281
Then where does he live?

29:15.602 --> 29:16.961
Could you tell me?

29:17.362 --> 29:18.642
He's usually at the station.

29:19.322 --> 29:20.441
He doesn't come back often.

29:59.922 --> 30:01.602
Mum, what's the matter?

30:02.322 --> 30:04.201
She looked like a tortured soul.

30:04.521 --> 30:05.402
Do you think

30:05.961 --> 30:07.681
I was too harsh on her?

30:07.761 --> 30:09.361
You call that being harsh?

30:09.362 --> 30:11.362
If it were me, I'd say worse things to her.

30:12.402 --> 30:13.922
Why would I do that?

30:14.001 --> 30:14.842
Why?

30:15.001 --> 30:16.681
Did you forget what she did to Yan?

30:16.761 --> 30:18.521
I've never met anyone more evil than her.

30:18.802 --> 30:19.961
How dare she come here.

30:21.001 --> 30:22.721
Didn't she go overseas to study?

30:22.802 --> 30:24.402
How come she's suddenly back?

30:25.001 --> 30:27.041
Why do you think she looked for Yan?

30:29.201 --> 30:30.361
Maybe she feels bad.

30:30.362 --> 30:32.601
With that cold and aloof attitude of hers,

30:32.602 --> 30:33.642
it'd be hard not to dislike her.

30:33.961 --> 30:36.322
Only my dumb brother thinks of her as a gem.

30:36.481 --> 30:38.441
Now that she's realised no one likes her,

30:38.882 --> 30:40.201
she's reminded of Yan's goodness.

30:40.721 --> 30:43.241
I was just wondering about Yan's weird behaviour lately.

30:45.802 --> 30:47.162
Do you think he still likes her?

30:48.001 --> 30:49.161
No way.

30:49.162 --> 30:50.361
Yan must hate her to the core.

30:50.362 --> 30:51.802
How could he still like her?

30:52.602 --> 30:53.882
You have no idea.

30:53.922 --> 30:56.201
These past years, I've tried to set him up on many blind dates.

30:56.441 --> 30:58.401
He either said he was too busy to go,

30:58.402 --> 31:00.546
or he wasn't interested after meeting them.

31:01.402 --> 31:02.721
There's no way.

31:02.961 --> 31:04.081
Even if Yan had to be single forever,

31:04.082 --> 31:05.321
she's a no-no.

31:05.322 --> 31:07.081
Did he forget how much he suffered because of her?

31:07.082 --> 31:07.681
This is...

31:08.642 --> 31:09.201
This won't do.

31:09.202 --> 31:10.602
I'm going to talk some sense into him.

31:11.842 --> 31:13.240
He likes being tortured, huh?

31:13.241 --> 31:14.041
I won't have...

31:15.162 --> 31:16.041
My lady.

31:16.042 --> 31:18.001
Stay out of Yan's business.

31:25.041 --> 31:26.922
Stop shaking your leg. Go and read.

32:01.162 --> 32:02.601
Doctor, my baby got burned.

32:02.602 --> 32:03.681
Please treat her quickly.

32:03.882 --> 32:04.802
Did you get a number?

32:05.521 --> 32:06.521
You need a number for emergency care?

32:06.522 --> 32:07.841
Yes, you need to register for emergency care too.

32:07.842 --> 32:10.122
What a stupid hospital. I got burned!

32:10.162 --> 32:11.162
Sir, please register her.

32:11.441 --> 32:12.719
Or else the system cannot dispense medication.

32:13.001 --> 32:13.721
Fine.

32:13.721 --> 32:14.721
Wait for me.

32:15.642 --> 32:17.322
Please wait outside. Thanks.

32:17.362 --> 32:18.562
Please wait outside.

32:23.802 --> 32:24.721
Get the medicine first

32:24.761 --> 32:25.961
and then get her an injection.

32:26.001 --> 32:26.721
Okay.

32:26.722 --> 32:27.760
Next time you get bitten by a dog,

32:27.761 --> 32:29.601
you can go to the CDC.

32:29.602 --> 32:30.721
No need to come to the general hospital.

32:30.922 --> 32:32.322
Okay, thanks.

32:37.802 --> 32:39.201
Doctor, quick!

32:39.481 --> 32:40.681
Please take a look.

32:41.041 --> 32:42.960
I've got a big, red patch from the burn.

32:42.961 --> 32:43.761
How did it happen?

32:43.762 --> 32:45.721
I accidentally burned my arm while taking hot water.

32:45.922 --> 32:46.681
Did it just happen?

32:48.842 --> 32:49.842
I registered. Here.

32:51.041 --> 32:52.562
It's all right. Let me give it a blow.

32:56.481 --> 32:58.201
Will it leave a scar?

32:58.681 --> 33:00.066
Don't worry. Relax.

33:02.802 --> 33:04.281
Here, this is the prescription.

33:04.362 --> 33:05.402
Go take the medicine as prescribed.

33:05.602 --> 33:06.922
That's it? That's all?

33:07.082 --> 33:08.041
Your wound is not serious.

33:08.041 --> 33:08.882
Use the topical cream for three days.

33:08.883 --> 33:10.481
But it's a huge red patch.

33:10.882 --> 33:11.802
-Dr Xu. -Yes?

33:11.803 --> 33:13.161
This firefighter is injured quite badly.

33:13.162 --> 33:14.481
-Please take a look. -Check him.

33:16.402 --> 33:17.049
Doctor.

33:20.001 --> 33:21.521
Go to the debridement room and get ready for sutures.

33:22.562 --> 33:24.322
Doctor! What about my wife?

33:24.521 --> 33:26.040
I gave you the prescription, didn't I?

33:26.041 --> 33:27.521
Just get the medicine stated there.

33:27.642 --> 33:29.281
You barely checked for a minute.

33:29.441 --> 33:30.441
Your injury is nothing serious.

33:30.442 --> 33:31.642
Use the prescribed medicine and it'll be fine.

33:33.802 --> 33:34.802
Did you really treat my wife's condition?

33:35.281 --> 33:36.480
It was barely 10 seconds.

33:36.481 --> 33:38.201
I don't have time to argue with you right now. Let's go.

33:39.642 --> 33:40.322
Stop right there!

33:40.323 --> 33:41.562
You're leaving my wife to suffer?

33:44.882 --> 33:45.961
Are you being rough on a woman?

33:46.122 --> 33:48.041
Didn't your parents teach you better?

33:48.201 --> 33:49.721
Who are you? I'm looking for her.

33:50.642 --> 33:51.720
Are you done?

33:51.721 --> 33:53.441
Let go of my husband!

33:56.041 --> 33:56.842
Remember your job.

33:56.842 --> 33:57.842
Don't just stand here and ogle.

33:59.402 --> 34:00.322
Go and get your medicine.

34:00.481 --> 34:01.281
Let's hurry.

34:02.201 --> 34:03.001
I'll wait here.

34:09.282 --> 34:10.041
Hang in there.

34:10.042 --> 34:11.362
I'll inject the anaesthetic soon.

34:11.882 --> 34:12.882
Thanks, Doctor.

34:12.922 --> 34:14.362
Let me clean you up.

34:14.961 --> 34:15.481
Come.

34:15.482 --> 34:16.521
Lift your arm.

34:21.521 --> 34:23.041
Don't move around.

34:23.322 --> 34:24.202
This hand is fine.

34:24.202 --> 34:25.041
I can do it myself.

34:25.042 --> 34:26.480
No, this hand looks swollen.

34:26.481 --> 34:27.081
It's dirty.

34:27.362 --> 34:28.641
I can't let you do it yourself.

34:31.961 --> 34:33.641
What happened to your arm?

34:34.961 --> 34:35.961
Someone tried to jump off a bridge.

34:36.001 --> 34:37.322
Thank goodness nothing bad happened.

34:37.402 --> 34:38.041
We saved him.

34:38.362 --> 34:39.762
Wasn't there any ambulance on the scene?

34:40.121 --> 34:41.081
I didn't see one.

34:41.081 --> 34:42.041
My colleague

34:42.121 --> 34:43.481
just bundled me up and brought me here.

34:43.641 --> 34:45.762
You should make a complaint if no ambulance went there.

34:45.882 --> 34:46.921
Wait a minute, Dr Xu.

34:46.922 --> 34:49.041
The ambulance and us are under the same roof.

34:49.481 --> 34:50.322
Right.

34:50.601 --> 34:51.960
When calamity strikes,

34:51.961 --> 34:53.402
we're all on the same boat.

34:53.481 --> 34:54.922
No reason to point fingers.

34:55.242 --> 34:56.121
You doctors

34:56.202 --> 34:57.322
and us firefighters,

34:57.402 --> 34:59.440
we're all family, right?

34:59.441 --> 35:00.641
It's tough for all of us.

35:01.282 --> 35:02.362
I'm injecting the anaesthetic.

35:03.762 --> 35:04.481
Please be gentle.

35:04.482 --> 35:06.282
I don't like needles.

35:20.441 --> 35:21.641
Did you die just now?

35:23.842 --> 35:24.882
That man was being unreasonable

35:25.001 --> 35:26.362
and was about to hit the doctor. Didn't you see?

35:27.561 --> 35:28.921
It wasn't like that. I was...

35:28.922 --> 35:29.802
If I hadn't come,

35:29.922 --> 35:31.202
would you just let her get beaten up?

35:31.402 --> 35:32.721
No way, Boss.

35:32.722 --> 35:33.921
Anyway, nothing happened.

35:33.922 --> 35:35.041
I'm not your boss.

35:35.402 --> 35:36.362
You're my boss.

35:36.922 --> 35:37.762
Hey...

35:40.601 --> 35:41.842
Hang on.

35:44.322 --> 35:45.722
Do you know that doctor?

35:49.001 --> 35:49.842
No, I don't.

35:50.362 --> 35:52.322
If you don't, why are you so worried about her?

36:11.922 --> 36:12.521
How is it, Jiang?

36:12.521 --> 36:13.242
I'm all right.

36:13.842 --> 36:14.882
Thanks, Doctor.

36:14.961 --> 36:16.681
Pay the fees and then get anti-inflammatory medication.

36:16.682 --> 36:18.882
Got it. Thanks, Miss, Doctor.

36:20.202 --> 36:20.802
Looking for someone?

36:21.282 --> 36:22.882
Our captain just left. He went that way.

36:25.521 --> 36:26.601
Go get your medication.

36:27.242 --> 36:28.001
Thank you.

36:28.161 --> 36:29.561
We'll be off then. Thanks, Miss.

36:30.362 --> 36:31.121
Are you okay?

36:36.402 --> 36:37.402
I'm taking over, Dr Xu.

36:56.521 --> 36:57.242
Song Yan!

37:02.121 --> 37:02.922
Song Yan.

37:05.362 --> 37:06.081
Yes?

37:08.282 --> 37:09.001
Well...

37:10.882 --> 37:11.961
Long time no see.

37:13.282 --> 37:14.362
Yes, pretty long.

37:19.441 --> 37:20.441
Have you been well

37:21.242 --> 37:22.362
the past years?

37:23.202 --> 37:24.001
Not too bad.

37:24.202 --> 37:24.922
And you?

37:28.641 --> 37:29.435
Not good.

37:33.802 --> 37:34.762
Is there anything else?

37:37.842 --> 37:39.961
Thanks for just now.

37:40.402 --> 37:41.380
I did it for my brother.

37:43.398 --> 37:44.362
And the last time...

37:44.617 --> 37:45.317
Xu Qin,

37:46.242 --> 37:47.282
what do you wish to say?

37:52.121 --> 37:54.081
Do you have time to have a cup of coffee?

37:58.762 --> 37:59.561
Do you?

38:03.842 --> 38:05.961
Many people want to treat me to coffee.

38:06.961 --> 38:07.922
Get in line.

38:11.121 --> 38:12.362
I'll call you when it's your turn.

38:21.253 --> 38:25.558
(Together We Eliminate Fire Hazards, Join Hands to Build a Safe Society)

38:25.661 --> 38:27.226
(119)

38:55.521 --> 38:57.201
I hope you will think of me

38:57.202 --> 38:58.601
every time you want to smoke.

38:59.481 --> 39:00.402
Song Yan,

39:00.403 --> 39:02.001
I don't like you to smoke.

39:02.202 --> 39:04.282
My mum won't like you smoking, too.

39:06.041 --> 39:06.722
I'll stop.
